{"Removal of findMany and replacement with getBaseConditions breaks service encapsulation - callers now need to know how to construct $queryRaw queries and understand the table structure": 0.7726039290428162, "Service layer API inconsistency - InsightsRoutingService maintains a findMany method that encapsulates data access while InsightsBookingService now forces callers to handle raw query execution": 0.49262648820877075, "Test code performs raw SQL queries directly which undermines service layer encapsulation - integration tests should call service methods that return results, not conditions": 0.3925003111362457, "Type safety regression - switching from Prisma.BookingTimeStatusDenormalizedWhereInput to raw Prisma.sql templates loses compile-time schema validation, typos in column names won't be caught until runtime": 0.8391741514205933, "Integration tests validate exact SQL structure rather than query behavior, coupling them to implementation details and making them fragile to benign formatting changes": 0.5011589527130127}